00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:49.560
mitochondrial protein acts as one of the direct bridges carrying those timing signals into brown fat metabolism.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:54.660
right now your brown fat is using that protein to match heat production to the

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:59.140
